        "operationId": "createWarehouse",
        "description": "Creates and registers a new warehouse in SOMA Software.\n\nThe created warehouse will be enabled for:\n- Inventory management\n- Logistics and dispatch operations\n- Component control and tracking\n\n## Supported Warehouse Types\n\n- Central physical warehouses\n- Satellite warehouses\n- Temporary warehouses\n- Operational base-associated warehouses\n",
